    "7": {
      "note": "Per-leaf judgment state is now published separately from comparison facts and consumed by the sole change-set model. It stores categories/grades under repository/master/leaf, emits only when their serialized content changes and deletes empty judgment payloads. A live no-work move increments a leaf generation and re-reads the numbered leaf facts and currently asked invariant cards, while retaining the opening-set card-read owner. This publication carries inference data; it does not author knowledge or convert a grade into a recorded fact.\n\nAnchor: `publishLeafJudgments`, `usePublishLeafJudgments`, `useLeafJudgments`, `useChangeSet`",
